    "rawRetro": {
      "version": 1,
      "summary": "Added a signed-in 'Pipeline Smoke / 流程冒烟' page at /pipeline-smoke with a navigation entry, an in-memory counter starting at 0 and a +1 button; added EN/ZH strings and a component test. Repair round normalized the pre-existing double blank line in AGENTS.md that the whole-repo format:check rejected.",
      "blockers": [],
      "problems": [
        {
          "phase": "verification",
          "title": "format:check failed on AGENTS.md",
          "symptom": "pnpm format:check '!.github/**' reported 'AGENTS.md' as unformatted and exited 1, so verify.sh stopped before lint/typecheck/test ran.",
          "rootCause": "AGENTS.md contained two consecutive blank lines before '## Controlled failed-delivery smoke', introduced by the factory's own commit e318f4e. .github/scripts/format-changes.mjs only runs prettier --write on files changed by the task (git diff HEAD plus untracked), so a tracked, task-unchanged file was never normalized, while format:check scans the whole repository.",
          "resolution": "Ran prettier --write AGENTS.md, which removed the extra blank line (one-line whitespace-only change). AGENTS.md is application-owned guidance, not one of the prohibited factory control files (.github/, .npmrc, .gitmodules, config.yml), so editing its whitespace is allowed and does not change semantics.",
          "status": "resolved",
          "cost": "single repair round; format:auto already exited 0, only the manual AGENTS.md normalization was needed"
        }
      ],
      "improvements": [
        {
          "category": "framework",
          "title": "Template ships an AGENTS.md that fails format:check",
          "detail": "The committed AGENTS.md has a double blank line from commit e318f4e. Because format:auto only rewrites task-changed files, every task in this generated application starts with a whole-repo format:check failure unrelated to the task, and verify.sh aborts before lint/typecheck/test.",
          "suggestedChange": "Ship AGENTS.md already prettier-clean in the template (or add AGENTS.md to .prettierignore), so the baseline format:check passes for a task that touches no markdown.",
          "mechanizable": true
        },
        {
          "category": "framework",
          "title": "format:auto normalizes only changed files while format:check checks the whole repository",
          "detail": "The mismatch between the auto-fix scope (git diff HEAD + untracked) and the check scope (prettier .) means pre-existing formatting drift in any tracked file can never be auto-repaired, only surfaced as a failure the agent must interpret and fix by hand.",
          "suggestedChange": "Either have format-changes.mjs also normalize tracked files that format:check would reject, or scope the check to the changed set; at minimum report a baseline formatting failure separately from task-caused failures.",
          "mechanizable": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "acceptanceRequirements": "B01. 使用已有测试账号登录，从导航打开页面，确认标题、说明、初始值 0；点击“+1”后变为 1，保存一张点击后的截图。\n\n无法实际完成时如实记录 failed、blocked 或 not_run，不以静态源码检查代替浏览器通过。",
